---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Card from '../components/Card.astro';
import SectionHeader from '../components/SectionHeader.astro';
---

<Layout title="UBE - takmd" description="Unilateral Biportal Endoscopy philosophy, learning resources, and advanced concepts.">
  <section class="page-shell py-14">
    <h1 class="page-title-gradient text-4xl font-extrabold sm:text-5xl">Unilateral Biportal Endoscopy</h1>
  </section>

  <section class="page-shell pb-10">
    <SectionHeader icon="🩺" title="Philosophy of UBE" />
    <div class="space-y-4 text-[var(--color-text-secondary)]">
      <p>
        UBE is grounded in minimal tissue disruption while preserving a broad and stable endoscopic field. The approach
        prioritizes deliberate decompression through small portals instead of large exposures.
      </p>
      <p>
        Continuous saline irrigation supports clear visualization and steady hemostasis, allowing precise work around neural
        elements. This visibility changes decision quality during critical steps.
      </p>
      <p>
        The objective is not simply smaller incisions, but reproducible outcomes through measured instrument control,
        anatomic respect, and efficient recovery pathways.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="page-shell pb-10">
    <SectionHeader icon="🧭" title="Anchor-based Surgical Thinking" />
    <p class="max-w-3xl text-[var(--color-text-secondary)]">
      Anchor points are defined landmarks that guide orientation, decompression depth, and trajectory. This framework reduces
      uncertainty and improves consistency across straightforward and complex cases.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="page-shell pb-10">
    <SectionHeader icon="🎬" title="Educational Playlists" description="Curated procedural and concept-focused videos" />
    <div class="grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-2 xl:grid-cols-3">
      <Card title="Foundational UBE Cases" description="Coming soon" />
      <Card title="Advanced Decompression" description="Coming soon" />
      <Card title="Fusion and Revision Cases" description="Coming soon" />
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="page-shell pb-16">
    <SectionHeader icon="⚠️" title="Common Pitfalls & Advanced Concepts" />
    <ul class="list-disc space-y-2 pl-5 text-[var(--color-text-secondary)]">
      <li>Portal misalignment and unstable instrument trajectory</li>
      <li>Inadequate contralateral decompression despite acceptable ipsilateral view</li>
      <li>Bleeding control strategy before deep progression</li>
      <li>Safe expansion from focal decompression to broader bilateral goals</li>
    </ul>
  </section>
</Layout>
